flowchart TD
    User[Human / Task Goal] --> Agent[Python Agent: LangGraph State Machine]
    Agent -->|decides actions| RPC[JSON-RPC over Unix Domain Socket]
    RPC --> Server[Node.js Guidepup Daemon]
    Server --> Browser[Playwright Browser\nChromium]
    Server --> VO[macOS VoiceOver]
    Browser --> Web[Web Page / Accessibility Tree]
    VO --> Web
    Server --> State[SSOT Daemon State: URL, title, aria snapshot, VoiceOver state, screenshots, events]
    State --> Agent
    Server --> Logs[Logs + Event History]